<title>NEW ZEALAND: IPCL exchageable INP shares list in NZ.</title>
<headline>IPCL exchageable INP shares list in NZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent Press Communications (IPCL) exchangeable Independent Newspapers Plc (INP) shares listed on the New Zealand stock exchange at NZ$8.30/share on Monday.</p>
<p>IPCL is a subsidiary and bidding vehicle of INP in its takeover bid for New Zealand publisher Wilson and Horton, which expires on Friday, November 15.</p>
<p>IPCL is offering NZ$11 for each Wilson and Horton share, or 1.375 exchangeable INP shares.</p>
</text>
